{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Plantichrist</u></strong><br>Plantichrist is a Cosy Plant Shop Simulation game based within the realm: Purgatory.<br><br>You play as a devil who decided its time to quit their job in hell and move to purgatory, the land of the neutral species.<br>Whilst there, you learn about Horticulture and decide it'd be nice to make a plant shop and bring some life to the realm!<br><br>Within the game, you can create your own plants, sell them and decorate your shop!<br>Plantichrist is designed to be a stress-free game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962260?t=1760134502","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962260?t=1760134502","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962260/01798a2f01a4ff3f88b2e2898afb151ac2e73572/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760134502","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962260/01798a2f01a4ff3f88b2e2898afb151ac2e73572/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760134502","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Plantichrist</u></strong><br>Plantichrist is a Cosy Plant Shop Simulation game based within the realm: Purgatory.<br><br>You play as a devil who decided its time to quit their job in hell and move to purgatory, the land of the neutral species.<br>Whilst there, you learn about Horticulture and decide it'd be nice to make a plant shop and bring some life to the realm!<br><br>Within the game, you can create your own plants, sell them and decorate your shop!<br>Plantichrist is designed to be a stress-free game.</p>","developers":["Unboxed Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header